  "facts": [
    "Built in 1978, the Milchbuck Tunnel stretches 1,910 metres, carving a single‑lane artery beneath Zürich’s heart while an emergency lane bisects the passage.",
    "In 2006, emergency services upgraded the tunnel, adding a dedicated escape path to enhance safety for the 1‑lane traffic flow.",
    "Midway through the tunnel, the Weinberg rail tunnel passes beneath, making the Milchbuck a rare intersection of road and rail tunnels."
